@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.TeamNandaModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Nanda";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <div class="event-hero reveal">
            <div class="event-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Our Team</p>
                <h2>Nanda</h2>

                <p class="event-intro">
                    A Deaf barista who brings quality, care, and meaningful connection
                    into every service experience.
                </p>

                <div class="event-tags">
                    <span>Deaf Barista</span>
                    <span>Service Quality</span>
                    <span>Connection</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="team-profile-hero-img reveal">
                <img src="/images/team/nanda.jpg" alt="Nanda">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-block reveal">
            <div class="hbii-block-text">
                <p class="hbii-label">Her Journey</p>
                <h3>Choosing a Place With Meaning</h3>

                <p>
                    Nanda started her journey with Kopi Cinta on November 16, 2025.
                    Here, she works as a Deaf barista, focusing on providing the best
                    service for every customer.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Before joining, she already had experience as a barista. However,
                    she chose Kopi Cinta because she was interested in its concept—
                    not just about coffee, but also about service quality and meaningful
                    connection.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-block-card">
                <h4>Her Role</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>Deaf barista</li>
                    <li>Customer service</li>
                    <li>Quality-focused preparation</li>
                    <li>Clear communication</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-feature reveal">
            <div class="hbii-feature-card">
                <p class="hbii-label">Growth</p>
                <h3>Learning Through the Process</h3>

                <p>
                    During her time at Kopi Cinta, Nanda feels comfortable and truly
                    enjoys the process.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The environment allows her to keep learning, improving, and growing
                    every day.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hbii-feature-card soft">
                <p class="hbii-label">Challenge</p>
                <h3>Communication With Effort</h3>

                <p>
                    As a Deaf person, Nanda’s biggest challenge is communication.
                </p>

                <p>
                    She tries to overcome it in different ways—through writing,
                    lip-reading, and making sure instructions are clearly understood.
                </p>

                <p>
                    For her, communication will always work when both sides are willing
                    to try.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>Her Message</h3>

            <p>
                Through her experience, Nanda hopes hearing people can be more open
                when communicating with Deaf individuals.
            </p>

            <p>
                Writing can be very helpful, and it is a simple way to understand
                each other better.
            </p>

            <p>
                Because for her, connection is not always about sound—
                but about the effort to understand.
            </p>
        </div>

        <br />

        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Team" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Team</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>